WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.900
Chapter Four.

00:00:01.850 --> 00:00:04.587
The Pandemic Procurement Grift.

00:00:04.587 --> 00:00:10.212
ArriveCAN: 80,000 dollar estimate, 93 million dollar outcome.

00:00:10.212 --> 00:00:14.187
A two-person firm that never wrote a single line of code.

00:00:14.187 --> 00:00:18.675
76 percent of subcontractors performed zero work.

00:00:18.675 --> 00:00:25.100
